- [Characterization of CYP2D6 Pharmacogenetic Variation in Sub‐Saharan African Populations](https://ascpt.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/cpt.2749)

  > This enzyme is responsible for metabolizing certain drugs. This results in being a "fast" metabolizer in some cases increasing or decreasing drug exposure.
